{"synopsis":"Nama paling agung di tanah ini: Gauri. Sosok yang melindungi nama itu. Orang-orang menjulukinya Kaisar Besi! Dialah Ko Jin-cheon, jenderal besar terakhir dari Gauri (Goguryeo) yang telah runtuh.\n\nPada saat kekalahan terakhir, ia terjatuh ke dunia lain bersama pasukan elitnya, Kavaleri Hantu Berzirah Hitam. Sebuah negeri asing tempat para elf, orc, dwarf, dan penyihir hidup berdampingan. Jika mereka tak bisa kembali, maka mereka harus membangun Gauri yang baru.\n\nKo Jin-cheon pun kembali mengibarkan benderanya, menaklukkan benua sekali lagi.","alternative_title":"강철의 열제","author":"Gauri, Suri","artist":"Shin Inseong","chapters":[{"number":"50","chapter":"50","slug":"30bc95f7-699b-4e4b-a3ef-45434ffdd94c","title":"Chapter 50","date":"2026-06-02"},{"number":"49","chapter":"49","slug":"ab189b06-0983-4051-892b-27470153aaa5","title":"Chapter 49","date":"2026-05-26"},{"number":"48","chapter":"48","slug":"b6ee31fb-9b8a-4b9f-867a-c2357b82c721","title":"Chapter 48","date":"2026-05-18"},{"number":"47","chapter":"47","slug":"38204de0-7d61-4f0d-bd49-13c05ce307fd","title":"Chapter 47","date":"2026-05-11"},{"number":"46","chapter":"46","slug":"4af419c4-6f0c-4775-812e-8d0d77ed07c6","title":"Chapter 46","date":"2026-05-04"},{"number":"45","chapter":"45","slug":"1fd7e383-ac4d-43f5-952a-02574acc6ad9","title":"Chapter 45","date":"2026-04-28"},{"number":"44","chapter":"44","slug":"c90b8031-525c-4424-b078-ca7bfe30ba52","title":"Chapter 44","date":"2026-04-20"},{"number":"43","chapter":"43","slug":"40f02919-f400-4fa6-89bf-5dba23fdfce0","title":"Chapter 43","date":"2026-04-16"},{"number":"42","chapter":"42","slug":"40461197-f513-4cd4-8f8d-5fa09cebdf11","title":"Chapter 42","date":"2026-04-09"},{"number":"41","chapter":"41","slug":"395ecc8c-3ca6-455f-b3eb-300d68fa206b","title":"Chapter 41","date":"2026-03-30"},{"number":"40","chapter":"40","slug":"0a9e76e8-b276-46a1-b8d2-5afaea06a0ae","title":"Chapter 40","date":"2026-03-25"},{"number":"39","chapter":"39","slug":"02637931-691